-    *   **Z Axis:**
-        *   If `velocity.Z > 0`: `kStep = 1`, `kComparison = CHUNK_SIZE`, `kReset = 0`, `zAccessIncrement = CHUNK_SIZE_SQUARED`, `zAccessReset = -CHUNK_SIZE_CUBED`, `zDist = (z - start.Z + 1)` [S2, unofficial][S3, unofficial].
