 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-*   **Self-intersection:** In rendering contexts (e.g., [S1, unofficial]), shadow rays are offset by `n * EPS` (where `EPS = 5e-5`) to avoid hitting the surface they originated from [S1, unofficial].
